# SolarEPC-Pro Phase 5: Enterprise Features

## Goal Description
Transform the tool into an Enterprise Platform by adding real-world data integration, specific equipment selection, visual design tools, advanced storage modeling, and customizable reporting.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Weather Data**: We will use PVGIS (free, no key required) for TMY data. This requires internet access.
> **Database**: Loading the full CEC database can be slow. We will cache it in `st.session_state`.
> **BESS**: We are re-introducing the Battery System, but with advanced "Peak Shaving" logic.

